        "jsCode": "// leave rows alone for 3 minutes so a slow, still-running FIN-02 is not started twice\nconst cutoff = Date.now() - 3 * 60 * 1000;\nreturn $input.all().filter(i => new Date(i.json.createdAt).getTime() < cutoff).slice(0, 10);"
